          "content": {
            "size": -1,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"book\":\"John\",\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"translation\":\"WEB\",\"verses\":[{\"id\":26670,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":1,\"text\":\"“Don’t let your heart be troubled. Believe in God. Believe also in me.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26671,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":2,\"text\":\"In my Father’s house are many homes. If it weren’t so, I would have told you. I am going to prepare a place for you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26672,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":3,\"text\":\"If I go and prepare a place for you, I will come again, and will receive you to myself; that where I am, you may be there also.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26673,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":4,\"text\":\"You know where I go, and you know the way.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26674,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":5,\"text\":\"Thomas said to him, “Lord, we don’t know where you are going. How can we know the way?”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26675,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":6,\"text\":\"Jesus said to him, “I am the way, the truth, and the life. No one comes to the Father, except through me.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26676,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":7,\"text\":\"If you had known me, you would have known my Father also. From now on, you know him, and have seen him.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26677,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":8,\"text\":\"Philip said to him, “Lord, show us the Father, and that will be enough for us.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26678,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":9,\"text\":\"Jesus said to him, “Have I been with you such a long time, and do you not know me, Philip? He who has seen me has seen the Father. How do you say, ‘Show us the Father?’\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26679,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":10,\"text\":\"Don’t you believe that I am in the Father, and the Father in me? The words that I tell you, I speak not from myself; but the Father who lives in me does his works.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26680,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":11,\"text\":\"Believe me that I am in the Father, and the Father in me; or else believe me for the very works’ sake.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26681,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":12,\"text\":\"Most certainly I tell you, he who believes in me, the works that I do, he will do also; and he will do greater works than these, because I am going to my Father.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26682,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":13,\"text\":\"Whatever you will ask in my name, I will do it, that the Father may be glorified in the Son.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26683,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":14,\"text\":\"If you will ask anything in my name, I will do it.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26684,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":15,\"text\":\"If you love me, keep my commandments.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26685,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":16,\"text\":\"I will pray to the Father, and he will give you another Counselor,  that he may be with you forever:\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26686,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":17,\"text\":\"the Spirit of truth, whom the world can’t receive; for it doesn’t see him and doesn’t know him. You know him, for he lives with you, and will be in you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26687,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":18,\"text\":\"I will not leave you orphans. I will come to you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26688,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":19,\"text\":\"Yet a little while, and the world will see me no more; but you will see me. Because I live, you will live also.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26689,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":20,\"text\":\"In that day you will know that I am in my Father, and you in me, and I in you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26690,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":21,\"text\":\"One who has my commandments and keeps them, that person is one who loves me. One who loves me will be loved by my Father, and I will love him, and will reveal myself to him.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26691,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":22,\"text\":\"Judas (not Iscariot) said to him, “Lord, what has happened that you are about to reveal yourself to us, and not to the world?”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26692,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":23,\"text\":\"Jesus answered him, “If a man loves me, he will keep my word. My Father will love him, and we will come to him, and make our home with him.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26693,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":24,\"text\":\"He who doesn’t love me doesn’t keep my words. The word which you hear isn’t mine, but the Father’s who sent me.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26694,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":25,\"text\":\"I have said these things to you while still living with you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26695,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":26,\"text\":\"But the Counselor, the Holy Spirit, whom the Father will send in my name, will teach you all things, and will remind you of all that I said to you.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26696,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":27,\"text\":\"Peace I leave with you. My peace I give to you; not as the world gives, I give to you. Don’t let your heart be troubled, neither let it be fearful.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26697,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":28,\"text\":\"You heard how I told you, ‘I go away, and I come to you.’ If you loved me, you would have rejoiced, because I said ‘I am going to my Father;’ for the Father is greater than I.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26698,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":29,\"text\":\"Now I have told you before it happens so that when it happens, you may believe.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26699,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":30,\"text\":\"I will no more speak much with you, for the prince of the world comes, and he has nothing in me.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},{\"id\":26700,\"book\":null,\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":31,\"text\":\"But that the world may know that I love the Father, and as the Father commanded me, even so I do. Arise, let’s go from here.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"}],\"total_verses\":31}"
          },
