            "text": "[{\"verse\":{\"id\":43014021,\"book\":\"John\",\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":14,\"verse\":21,\"text\":\"One who has my commandments and keeps them, that person is one who loves me. One who loves me will be loved by my Father, and I will love him, and will reveal myself to him.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0865452},{\"verse\":{\"id\":28003001,\"book\":\"Hosea\",\"book_number\":28,\"chapter\":3,\"verse\":1,\"text\":\"Yahweh said to me, “Go again, love a woman loved by another, and an adulteress, even as Yahweh loves the children of Israel, though they turn to other gods, and love cakes of raisins.”\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0865452},{\"verse\":{\"id\":42006032,\"book\":\"Luke\",\"book_number\":42,\"chapter\":6,\"verse\":32,\"text\":\"If you love those who love you, what credit is that to you? For even sinners love those who love them.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0865452},{\"verse\":{\"id\":62002015,\"book\":\"1 John\",\"book_number\":62,\"chapter\":2,\"verse\":15,\"text\":\"Don’t love the world or the things that are in the world. If anyone loves the world, the Father’s love isn’t in him.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":46013004,\"book\":\"1 Corinthians\",\"book_number\":46,\"chapter\":13,\"verse\":4,\"text\":\"Love is patient and is kind. Love doesn’t envy. Love doesn’t brag, is not proud,\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":49005028,\"book\":\"Ephesians\",\"book_number\":49,\"chapter\":5,\"verse\":28,\"text\":\"Even so husbands also ought to love their own wives as their own bodies. He who loves his own wife loves himself.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":43013034,\"book\":\"John\",\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":13,\"verse\":34,\"text\":\"A new commandment I give to you, that you love one another. Just as I have loved you, you also love one another.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":24031003,\"book\":\"Jeremiah\",\"book_number\":24,\"chapter\":31,\"verse\":3,\"text\":\"Yahweh appeared of old to me, saying, “Yes, I have loved you with an everlasting love. Therefore I have drawn you with loving kindness.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":39001002,\"book\":\"Malachi\",\"book_number\":39,\"chapter\":1,\"verse\":2,\"text\":\"“I have loved you,” says Yahweh. Yet you say, “How have you loved us?” “Wasn’t Esau Jacob’s brother?” says Yahweh, “Yet I loved Jacob;\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":9020017,\"book\":\"1 Samuel\",\"book_number\":9,\"chapter\":20,\"verse\":17,\"text\":\"Jonathan caused David to swear again, for the love that he had to him; for he loved him as he loved his own soul.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":43015009,\"book\":\"John\",\"book_number\":43,\"chapter\":15,\"verse\":9,\"text\":\"Even as the Father has loved me, I also have loved you. Remain in my love.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456},{\"verse\":{\"id\":62004007,\"book\":\"1 John\",\"book_number\":62,\"chapter\":4,\"verse\":7,\"text\":\"Beloved, let’s love one another, for love is of God; and everyone who loves has been born of God, and knows God.\",\"translation\":\"WEB\"},\"relevance\":0.0827456}]"
          },
